  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">PIMS 10117 - GCF NDA Readiness-Tunisia: Supporting NDC 3.0 preparation and enhancing NDC implementation in Tunisia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The readiness project aims to strengthen Tunisia&#x2019;s institutional capacities, strategic frameworks, and stakeholder engagement to enhance the implementation of its climate commitments, in particular its new NDC 3.0. By addressing systemic barriers - including insufficient coordination, limited technical expertise, and weak integration of gender considerations - the project outlines a clear pathway to foster low-emission, climate-resilient development in Tunisia.</narrative>
  </description>
